VIN layer (vin_wmi, vin_position) license

This layer has two parts with different terms; see SOURCE.md for details and attribution.

1. NHTSA vPIC data (rows sourced from the U.S. NHTSA Product Information Catalog / vPIC):
   U.S. Government work, public domain. No restriction.

2. Reconstructed structural rows (VIN position rules and some WMI entries) derived from the
   ISO 3779 VIN structure and publicly documented BMW WMI assignments (e.g. Wikibooks):
   the underlying references are CC-BY-SA-4.0. Attribute and share-alike where those rows apply.

